---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { clubProfile, mailto } from '../config/club-profile';
---

<BaseLayout title="Play Basketball" description={`Join ${clubProfile.name}. Learn how to get involved, find competition information and contact the club.`}>
  <section class="bg-brand-purple px-4 py-12 text-center lg:py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-200">Find your place at Phoenix</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Play Basketball</h1>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-4 h-1 w-16 bg-brand-gold"></div>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-purple-100">Build skills, make friends and enjoy basketball with your local community.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-brand-offwhite px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="joining-heading">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 id="joining-heading" class="mb-4 text-2xl font-black text-brand-purple">Interested in joining?</h2>
          <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Whether you're new to basketball or returning to the court, contact us to discuss a suitable team and the next steps. Team placement depends on age, experience and available places.</p>
          <ol class="space-y-5 text-gray-700">
            <li><h3 class="font-bold text-brand-purple">1. Get in touch</h3><p class="mt-1">Tell us the player's age and basketball experience. We'll help you understand the options.</p></li>
            <li><h3 class="font-bold text-brand-purple">2. Confirm your team and registration</h3><p class="mt-1">Check with the club before registering. We'll explain team availability, current fees and the appropriate registration process.</p></li>
            <li><h3 class="font-bold text-brand-purple">3. Get ready to play</h3><p class="mt-1">The club or your team will confirm training arrangements, uniform requirements and anything you need before taking the court.</p></li>
          </ol>
          <a href={mailto(clubProfile.contact.generalEmail, 'Playing Basketball Enquiry')} class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-purple px-6 py-3 text-center font-bold text-white hover:bg-purple-800">Enquire About Playing</a>
          <p class="mt-3 break-words text-sm text-gray-600">Or email <a href={mailto(clubProfile.contact.generalEmail)} class="font-semibold text-brand-purple underline">{clubProfile.contact.generalEmail}</a>.</p>
        </article>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-black text-brand-purple">Fixtures, results & ladders</h2>
            <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Find Phoenix on PlayHQ, select the relevant competition and season, then choose your team for fixtures, results and ladders.</p>
            <a href={clubProfile.basketball.playhqUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-purple px-6 py-3 text-center font-bold text-white hover:bg-purple-800">Find Phoenix on PlayHQ <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-black text-brand-purple">Club & season updates</h2>
            <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Follow our club Facebook page for registration announcements, season news and events. Training and team arrangements are confirmed through club and team communications.</p>
            <a href={clubProfile.socials.facebook.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center font-bold text-brand-purple underline">Visit Phoenix on Facebook <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Don't use Facebook? <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-brand-purple underline">Contact us</a> for help with current information.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-brand-purple">Seasons & teams</h2><p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Phoenix participates in local basketball through the Bendigo Basketball Association. Competitions run across summer and winter seasons. Contact the club for current age groups, playing opportunities and availability.</p></article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-brand-purple">Uniforms & training</h2><p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Before ordering a uniform, check sizing, playing numbers and ordering arrangements with the club. Your team will confirm where and when you train.</p></article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border-2 border-brand-gold bg-white p-6"><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-brand-purple">Financial assistance</h2><p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Our <a href="/about#slam-dunk" class="font-semibold text-brand-purple underline">Slam Dunk Bridging Fund</a> helps ensure financial circumstances don't stop participation. Contact the club confidentially to discuss support.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
